.superpowers/

# Device backups — contain per-device secrets (unifykey, bindkey, TEA license).
# Keep the README tracked so the backup layout is documented, but exclude the
# actual captured bytes (partitions and pulled /etc text files that may
# include shadow/passwd).
backups/**
!backups/README.md
